 wrong. I'm not trying to be the one voice against the world. I'm pointing to the physical world and the consensus of actual experts, and telling you that a children's book, unfortunately, got this one wrong because the myth is just that powerful and pervasive. It's a humbling moment when you realize the printed word isn't infallible, but it's also the moment you start thinking like a real scientist.
